      "18/06/2026 19:00\n\n# Sales Power 30 - Link Search Results\n\nPartner, I searched based on the flyer details.\n\nI could **not find a dedicated public registration page for this exact \"Sales Power 30\" batch starting 23 June 2026**, but I found the organization behind it.\n\n## Official website\n\nurlChithirai Community Official Websiteturn0search1\n\nThis appears to be the organisation promoting the event. citeturn0search1\n\n---\n\n## Social pages (likely where this event was posted)\n\n- urlChithirai Facebook Pageturn0search2\n- urlChithirai Instagram Pagehttps://www.instagram.com/chithirai.community/\n\nTheir Instagram regularly posts workshops, entrepreneur events and business learning sessions. citeturn0search3turn0search4\n\n---\n\n## Person shown in the flyer\n\nThe speaker appears to be:\n\nentity[\"people\",\"Jebakumar Swamidosan\",\"Founder of Chithirai\"]\n\nLinkedIn profile:\n\nurlJebakumar Swamidosan LinkedInturn0search0 citeturn0search0\n\n---\n\n## Information I could extract from your screenshots\n\n**Program:** Sales Power 30\n\n**Organizer:** Chithirai\n\n**Mode:** Zoom Live / Online classes\n\n**Starts:** 23 June 2026\n\n**Timing:** 8:00 PM – 10:00 PM\n\n**Duration:** 30 hours\n\n**Sessions:** 15 live sessions\n\n**Fee:** ₹4,500 (Introductory offer)\n\n**Contact number visible:** +91 63814 84021\n\nTopics shown:\n\n- Modern Sales Techniques\n- Customer Psychology\n- Prospecting & Lead Generation\n- Persuasive Presentations\n- Negotiation & Closing\n- Ethical & Value-Based Selling\n\nThe \"Out of the Box – Yelagiri\" image also looks like another Chithirai business ideation program. citeturn0search1\n\n### My observation\n\nThe flyer itself doesn't yet answer the exact trust questions it asks (\"Can I trust you?\") because I couldn't find:\n\n- Detailed curriculum PDF\n- Trainer credentials page\n- Testimonials page for this specific course\n- Direct registration page\n\nBefore paying ₹4,500, I would ask for:\n\n1. Official registration link\n2. Full 15-session syllabus\n3. Recording availability\n4. Previous batch testimonials\n5. GST invoice/business details\n\nIf this came through your **Eswari Sis BPO Number** contact, I can also help you assess **whether this is a good program for Annai BPO / telecalling teams or mostly generic sales training.**"
     ]
